#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralpage.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:tab General settings for a folder."
msgid "General"
msgstr "Općenito"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralpage.cpp:64
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:textbox Name of the folder."
msgid "Folder &Name:"
msgstr "&Naziv mape:"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralpage.cpp:109
#, kde-format
msgid "Share unread state with all users"
msgstr "Dijeli stanje nepročitanih poruka sa svim korisnicima"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralpage.cpp:112
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If enabled, the unread state of messages in this folder will be the same for "
"all users having access to this folder. If disabled (the default), every "
"user with access to this folder has their own unread state."
msgstr ""
"Ako je omogućeno, stanje pročitanosti poruka u ovoj mapi bit će jednako za "
"sve korisnike koji joj imaju pristup. Ako je onemogućeno (zadana postavka), "
"svaki korisnik s pristupom ovoj mapi imat će vlastito stanje pročitanosti."

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralpage.cpp:211
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You have configured this folder to contain groupware information. That means "
"that this folder will disappear once the configuration dialog is closed."
msgstr ""
"Postavili ste ovu mapu za pohranu informacija za grupni rad. To znači da će "
"ova mapa nestati nakon zatvaranja dijaloga za postavljanje."

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:25
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Act on new/unread mail in this folder"
msgstr "Obavijesti o novoj/nepročitanoj pošti u ovoj mapi"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>If this option is enabled then you will be notified about new/unread "
"mail in this folder. Moreover, going to the next/previous folder with unread "
"messages will stop at this folder.</p><p>Uncheck this option if you do not "
"want to be notified about new/unread mail in this folder and if you want "
"this folder to be skipped when going to the next/previous folder with unread "
"messages. This is useful for ignoring any new/unread mail in your trash and "
"spam folder.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>Ako je ova mogućnost omogućena, dobit ćete obavijest o novoj/"
"nepročitanoj pošti u ovoj mapi. Osim toga, pri prelasku na sljedeću/"
"prethodnu mapu s nepročitanim porukama zaustavit ćete se na ovoj mapi.</p>"
"<p>Poništite ovu mogućnost ako ne želite primati obavijesti o novoj/"
"nepročitanoj pošti u ovoj mapi i želite preskočiti ovu mapu pri prelasku na "
"sljedeću/prethodnu mapu s nepročitanim porukama. To je korisno za "
"zanemarivanje nove/nepročitane pošte u otpadu i mapi neželjene pošte.</p></qt>"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:38
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Keep replies in this folder"
msgstr "Zadrži odgovore u ovoj mapi"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want replies you write to mails in this folder to "
"be put in this same folder after sending, instead of in the configured sent-"
"mail folder."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu mogućnost ako želite da se odgovori na poruke iz ove mape "
"nakon slanja smještaju u istu mapu, a ne u postavljenu mapu poslane pošte."

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:46
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Hide this folder in the folder selection dialog"
msgstr "Sakrij ovu mapu u dijalogu za odabir mape"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:48
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Check this option if you do not want this folder to be shown in folder "
"selection dialogs, such as the <interface>Jump to Folder</interface> dialog."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite ovu mogućnost ako ne želite da se ova mapa prikazuje u dijalozima "
"za odabir mape, kao što je dijalog <interface>Prijeđi na mapu</interface>."

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Use &default identity"
msgstr "Koristi &zadani identitet"

#: collectionpage/collectiongeneralwidget.cpp:60
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the sender identity to be used when writing new mail or replying to "
"mail in this folder. This means that if you are in one of your work folders, "
"you can make KMail use the corresponding sender email address, signature and "
"signing or encryption keys automatically. Identities can be set up in the "
"main configuration dialog. (Settings -> Configure KMail)"
msgstr ""
"Odaberite identitet pošiljatelja koji će se koristiti pri pisanju nove "
"poruke ili odgovaranju na poruke u ovoj mapi. Tako KMail može automatski "
"koristiti odgovarajuću adresu e-pošte pošiljatelja, potpis te ključeve za "
"potpisivanje ili šifriranje kada ste u jednoj od poslovnih mapa. Identitete "
"možete postaviti u glavnom dijalogu za postavljanje (Postavke -> Postavi KMail)."

